1
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,130
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,190
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,260
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:15,000
(Uncle)

10
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:17,280
(Your grandma is still alive.)

11
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:19,159
(But how long she lives depends)

12
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,239
(on when you come home.)

13
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:39,120
What do you want?

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:40,799
Mingyu,

15
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,480
you've been enjoying yourself
out there lately, huh?

16
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:45,560
You even forgot to call your family.

17
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:50,200
But let me remind you.

18
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:53,239
You have your grandma
to care for at home.

19
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,959
Especially Grandma.

20
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,760
She's not well.

21
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,400
She can't take much.

22
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,120
I'll be home tomorrow.

23
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,840
I knew our Mingyu

24
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,519
would be a good girl.

25
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:05,879
Also...

26
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:07,760
Don't forget to sort

27
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,319
things out with Duan Xiuming.

28
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,140
=Quite The Girl=

29
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:13,200
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

30
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:13,920
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

31
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,400
=Episode 14=

32
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,319
(Well done.)

33
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:54,560
What's so funny?

34
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:56,719
I like you.

35
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,080
Now you know it?

36
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,120
Taken from "Deer call in the wild,
their voices never die,"

37
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,439
your name's lovely.

38
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,599
What about you?

39
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,080
What's your name?

40
00:04:05,199 --> 00:04:06,000
Duan Xiuming.

41
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,840
Remember my name.

42
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,479
Lu Mingyu.

43
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,400
Once I finish things in Xizi City,

44
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,800
come with me to Xiangjiang.

45
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,879
I want to marry you.

46
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,439
Wait!

47
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:24,800
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

48
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:30,463
♪So this is what love feels like♪

49
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:38,586
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

50
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:45,800
♪I want to grow old with you♪

51
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:54,920
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

52
00:04:55,200 --> 00:05:01,207
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

53
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:08,080
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

54
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,879
(Whether we break up or cut ties,)

55
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,720
(please,)

56
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,560
(live well and proud.)

57
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:24,160
♪With you by my side♪

58
00:05:24,877 --> 00:05:30,840
♪Every day is a gentle embrace♪

59
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:41,480
(I CAPULETI E I MONTECCHI)

60
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,399
Hello?

61
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,199
(At the studio?)

62
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:54,800
(It's pouring outside.)

63
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:55,399
(I'll come get you.)

64
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:56,680
(Wait for me.)

65
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,639
Okay, I'll wait.

66
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:06,640
(NIAL Haus)

67
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,560
(Cream)
Come on. Let's go home.

68
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,240
I got you a gift.

69
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,720
What's the big secret?

70
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:26,680
What's this?

71
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,199
The chessboard man?

72
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,240
It's you.

73
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,920
I'm a chessboard?

74
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:38,720
To me,

75
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:40,199
you're just a chess game.

76
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,639
And it's over.

77
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,399
What do you mean?

78
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:46,560
Duan Xiuming.

79
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,160
We should break up.

80
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:57,079
Why?

81
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:58,879
From the very start,

82
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:01,720
you were just a pawn to help me escape.

83
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,279
Now the game is over.

84
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:05,360
And my life can go back to normal.

85
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,920
And you...

86
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,600
You're no longer needed.

87
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:10,399
Then what we had...

88
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:11,519
It was just a game.

89
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:13,160
You know,

90
00:07:13,519 --> 00:07:14,759
I'm in a new place now.

91
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,319
I need a little distraction.

92
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:22,760
(I CAPULETI E I MONTECCHI)

93
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:30,160
Lu Mingye, what am I to you?

94
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,279
What are you?

95
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,560
Just a backup to kill some time.

96
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:37,240
And you thought I'd marry you?

97
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,439
Don't flatter yourself.

98
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:42,279
What's really going on?

99
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,800
Is it Qin Lian again?

100
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:46,759
Tell me.

101
00:07:47,839 --> 00:07:49,000
What else could it be?

102
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,319
I met a man at school

103
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:51,800
with more clout than you.

104
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:53,360
I have better options.

105
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:54,879
To me, you're

106
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:56,480
no longer any use.

107
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,920
(Cream)

108
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,160
Lu Mingye.

109
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,480
Did you ever love me?

110
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,439
No.

111
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:19,519
Not for a second.

112
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:37,519
Lu Mingye!

113
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:39,960
Say it clearly!

114
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:44,080
(BUS STAND)

115
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:51,919
I don't believe you.

116
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,360
I've made it clear. Let go.

117
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,120
I don't believe you.

118
00:08:57,679 --> 00:08:58,799
(When you're grabbed,)

119
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:00,440
(don't waste your strength fighting me.)

120
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,200
(Move closer to me.)

121
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:04,039
(Lean your body back.)

122
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:04,640
(BUS STAND)

123
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,039
(Cross your hands over mine.)

124
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:10,600
(Push.)

125
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,800
(BUS STAND)

126
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:21,080
(Feel my center of gravity.)

127
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:24,279
(BUS STAND)
(When I move forward, you step back.)

128
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:25,799
(Three.)

129
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,240
(Two.)

130
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,000
(One.)

131
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:32,560
♪Maybe we met by chance♪
(BUS STAND)

132
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:39,040
♪One glance, and I fell♪

133
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:44,216
♪The moment we passed by♪

134
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,440
Self-defense...

135
00:09:47,679 --> 00:09:48,440
You used it

136
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,600
on me?

137
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,560
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

138
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,240
Don't show your face again.

139
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,000
Or I won't hold back.

140
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,840
♪Waiting is all I know♪

141
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:04,080
♪Wherever you go♪

142
00:10:05,054 --> 00:10:06,640
♪Oh, you♪
(BUS STAND)

143
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,120
Okay.

144
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,000
♪Wherever you are♪

145
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,559
Remember every word you said.

146
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:13,080
♪Wherever you go♪

147
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,000
♪Wherever you go♪

148
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,240
And I will!

149
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,240
♪For you♪

150
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:23,400
♪Wherever you are♪

151
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:27,000
♪Wherever you go♪

152
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:43,920
♪Whenever I recall your silent profile♪

153
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:49,800
♪Longing fills my empty hours♪

154
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:55,801
♪You're used to bearing it alone,
never with a sigh♪

155
00:10:56,920 --> 00:11:03,127
♪I'll be your harbor,
shield you from the rainy sky♪

156
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:06,680
♪I'm always here♪

157
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,640
♪Waiting is all I know♪

158
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:14,280
♪Wherever you go♪

159
00:11:15,047 --> 00:11:16,800
♪Oh, you♪

160
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,440
♪Wherever you are♪

161
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:49,620
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

162
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:56,000
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

163
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:03,790
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

164
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:09,860
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

165
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:18,430
♪A love letter written in song♪

166
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:23,940
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

167
00:12:26,450 --> 00:12:32,380
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

168
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:39,170
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

169
00:12:39,430 --> 00:12:46,350
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

170
00:12:47,310 --> 00:12:49,840
♪Close your eyes and count♪

171
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:52,480
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

172
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:58,980
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
